                                "sense_id": "6271102c-3b34-3c5e-8381-f6ebb252d9ec",
                                "text": "The los had been brought from a northern part of the United States."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a036b0c-e151-4bdf-8838-c00d381b2f6f",
                                "sense_id": "6271102c-3b34-3c5e-8381-f6ebb252d9ec",
                                "text": "A beaſt like unto a wolfe having many ſpottes, and being exceeding quicke of ſight: a wolfe like an hart, a Los or Lynx."
                            }
                        ]
